# Dusk Rose Reliquary: "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice an artifact or creature" (a creature here: Healer's
# Hawk; the choice is also offered the Mox Pearl, never a land) and "When this artifact enters, exile target artifact or creature
# an opponent controls until this artifact leaves the battlefield" (CR 610.3). The target may not be Bot1's own Mox Pearl or
# Bot2's Forest; it is Bot2's Llanowar Elves, though Bot2's Mox Jet was a legal choice too (so the question is asked). When Bot1 Disenchants its own Reliquary (ward only watches opponents), the Elves return.

